# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# BEKA frontend configuration
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Base URL of the backend API that implements the REST contract documented in
# backend-reference/README.md. Injected at BUILD time (Vite inlines VITE_* vars),
# so set this before running `npm run build`.
#
# Examples:
#   Same origin behind a reverse proxy:   /api
#   Separate API host:                     https://api.your-domain.com
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
